ES:
{{TAG:0003:0020:}}¡Ah, hola! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}¡Cuánto tiempo!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}¿Te acuerdas de mí?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0023:}}¡Soy {{TAG:0005:0001:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ¡De la acampada!
¡Te había prometido mudarme aquí!
Sí, ya veo que me recuerdas.
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Después de esa excursión, empecé
a preparar la mudanza rápidamente.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}
¡Ya llevo un tiempo aquí!
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Bueno, ¡supongo que nos veremos
mucho por el pueblo! ¡Hasta luego,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0020:}}Hep, {{TAG:0005:0008:}} !{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Ça fait un bail !{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Tu m'remets ?{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0025:}}{{TAG:0005:0001:}} !{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0002:}}Hi hi !{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Tu m'as complètement zappée, ma
parole !
Ça fait plus d'une semaine que j'ai
emménagé, et tu t'en es même pas
rendu compte !{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}J't'avais promis d'venir vivre ici la
fois où on avait causé, au camping...{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ben j'ai tenu ma promesse !
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}J'imagine qu'on va s'voir souvent,
maintenant !{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} À plus,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}} !

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0020:}}Ma sei tu, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}} Non ti ricordi proprio di me?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Sono {{TAG:0005:0001:}}!
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Mmmh...{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Come pensavo...
Hai rimosso l'accaduto!
{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Del resto sono qui già da un po'!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Quando ero in città solo
per campeggiare ho deciso
che ci sarei venuta ad abitare!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Io faccio sempre quello che dico.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ci vedremo spesso, credo, e magari
te ne ricorderai, {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0020:}}Vay, kimleri görüyorum, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Off, beni
hatırlamadın mı?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} Ben {{TAG:0005:0001:}}! {{TAG:0003:0024:}}Hımmmm...{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Unutmuş olabileceğini düşünmüştüm!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Sonuçta bir süredir buradayım!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}} {{TAG:0003:0015:}}Daha
