{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Ha?!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} Hey, sen buralı mısın?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Off{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Galiba
