IT:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Oooh!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} Alla fine ti sei fatt{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}} viv{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Eh eh eh{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} è solo che mi faceva
piacere fare due chiacchiere con te!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Sei {{TAG:0005:0000:}}, no?{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Io mi chiamo {{TAG:0005:0001:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} Mi sono
appena trasferita in città da
{{TAG:0011:0002:0000}}!{{TAG:0003:0025:}}
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Una persona che abitava qui mi
aveva parlato del posto fin nei
minimi particolari!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Ora che abito qui però, questa
persona è andata via! La mia
solita fortuna!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Beh, comunque sia, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}non mi è
dispiaciuto parlare con te,
{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

FR:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Hein ?!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0008:}} ?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0002:}}Arf !{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} J'voulais
essayer d'te prendre par surprise{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
mais t'as été plus rapide !{{TAG:0003:0025:}}
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Tu vois pas qui j'suis ?{{TAG:0007:0000:19000000}} Tssss...{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}{{TAG:0005:0001:}} bien sûr, qui d'autre ?!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}En fait, j'campais dans les parages
quand on m'a gentiment invitée à
venir vivre en ville.
{{TAG:0003:000A:}}Et bien sûr, la personne en question
a déménagé entre-temps{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:19000000}} Tu
l'crois, ça ?!
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Enfin...{{TAG:0007:0000:19000000}} Tu devrais m'faire visiter le
coin quand j'aurai fini d'm'installer,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}} ! Si ça t'dérange pas !

IT:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Ah!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Sei tu, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?!
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Ah ah!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Volevo spaventarti, ma{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
ti sei girat{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}} troppo presto!{{TAG:0003:0025:}}
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Ti ricordi di me?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} {{TAG:0003:0025:}}Sono {{TAG:0005:0001:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Una persona del posto mi ha
convinta a trasferirmi in città...
... mentre ero in zona solo per
campeggiare, quindi ora abito qui!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000A:}}La persona con cui avevo parlato,
però, ora non c'è! Avrà aspettato
che arrivassi io per andarsene{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Ehi, che ne dici di tornare a
trovarmi?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Questi scatoloni sono
un po' ingombranti, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Ehi!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0008:}}?! Allora sei tu!!!{{TAG:0003:0024:}}
Cominciavo a chiedermi se ti saresti
mai fermat{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}} a parlare con me!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Ti ricordi di me?{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:000D:}}Sono {{TAG:0005:0001:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Abito qui, ora!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Quando ero ancora nella mia città,
{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}una persona di qui mi ha suggerito
di trasferirmi nella sua, di città.
{{TAG:0003:000A:}}Al momento questa persona non
abita più da queste parti. Eh sì,
ci sono rimasta male anch'io{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Comunque sia,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} non è stato male
rivederti, {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Boah, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Bist du das?!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}
Ich dachte schon, du hättest mich
vergessen!{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Weißt du überhaupt noch, wer ich
bin?{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:000D:}}Na, {{TAG:0005:0001:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Ich wohn
doch jetzt auch hier in {{TAG:0005:0005:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}So 'n Spaßvogel meinte, dass es
mir hier gefallen würde,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} also bin
ich ganz spontan hierhergezogen!
{{TAG:0003:000A:}}Aber natürlich wohnt die Trantüte
selbst nicht mehr hier{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Voll unverschämt!
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Mir erst den Floh ins Ohr setzen{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}und dann einfach abhauen! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Wenigstens hab ich dich noch!
